# Conformance probe pack for ruling 9 of 0.56: a default on a line whose member
# another line writes is still checked. Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-range-056-6
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   probe.x  v  int
field   probe.y  v  int  range 0 10
default probe.y  99
